  {
    "_comment": "\"voiced\": true marks a sound the CREATURE makes rather than one the DEVICE",
    "_comment2": "makes. Only those resolve through the speaking creature's voice: they are",
    "_comment3": "pitched by it, and they look for <species>_<id> and <family>_<id> first (the",
    "_comment4": "families further down). feed/clean/heal are the player's actions and win and",
    "_comment5": "levelup are the game congratulating you, so none of those are voiced.",
    "id": "_voices"
  },

